   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Info line: Actuals are entered per legal entity × region × planning model. Only External invoices reduce stock; Own Region and Group are intra-group. Type the Total as your source shows it — the mask does not\ncalculate it, and flags it when it differs from External + Own Region + Group. The opening inventory has its own mask — see Opening inventory.",
