   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Difference = Total − (External + Own Region + Group), from the engine. Zero shows \"0\"; non-zero shows a warning icon, the value and the tooltip \"Typed Total differs from the sum of the three categories by\n<difference>\". Warning only: it does not block the landing.\nCheck column: when Check differs from Orderbook External, warning icon and tooltip \"Check ≠ External order book: <difference>\". Warning only; does not block the landing.\nEditable cells are white; calculated cells are grey with a lock icon and the word \"calculated\" in the header.",
   "originalText": "Difference = Total − (External + Own Region + Group), from the engine. Zero shows \"0\"; non-zero shows a warning icon, the value and the tooltip \"Typed Total differs from the sum of the three categories by\n<difference>\". Warning only: it does not block the landing.\nCheck column: when Check differs from Orderbook External, warning icon and tooltip \"Check ≠ External order book: <difference>\". Warning only; does not block the landing.\nEditable cells are white; calculated cells are grey with a lock icon and the word \"calculated\" in the header.",
   "fontSize": 9,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
