   "text": "States:\nempty — \"No planning models for this filter\"\nloading — skeleton grid\nerror — cell errors with messages (\"Planning model not assigned to this region\", \"Invoiced units must be 0 or more\"); landing error \"Nothing landed — <engine message>\" with \"Retry\"\nread-only — banner with the server's reason\nsuccess — result strip as above",
   "originalText": "States:\nempty — \"No planning models for this filter\"\nloading — skeleton grid\nerror — cell errors with messages (\"Planning model not assigned to this region\", \"Invoiced units must be 0 or more\"); landing error \"Nothing landed — <engine message>\" with \"Retry\"\nread-only — banner with the server's reason\nsuccess — result strip as above",
   "fontSize": 12,
